  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p> Your adversary rams his weapon into your solar plexus, rupturing the diaphragm muscles that are your main breathing musculature, also damaging your abdominal aorta. It’s even odds as to whether you die from suffocation or blood loss!</p> <p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Fatigued] (4) and @Condition[Bleeding] (2), the latter of which cannot be removed without Surgery. Should you fail to bleed to death, then for healing purposes it’ll count as a Torn Muscle (Major) with partial healing reducing your Condition from @Condition[Fatigued] (4) to @Condition[Fatigued] (2), but full healing still leaving you permanently @Condition[Fatigued] (1).</p>"
    },
